{"id":"n58153-1-10","stage":1,"title":"전화번호 · 电话号码","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58153-1-10-1","ko":"민준 씨는 전화번호가 어떻게 돼요?","zh":"敏俊，你的电话号码是多少呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨는","audio":"/audio/1e98662e92cdd5672d9e.mp3"}},{"text":"전화번호가","meaning":"电话号码","explanation":"전화번호：电话号码；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전화번호","audio":"/audio/4edc94394feec0a6ca6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58153","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화번호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화번호가","audio":"/audio/4a9944c1c075a6b01b76.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"是、为（询问电话号码）","explanation":"되다：是、为（询问电话号码）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"4edc94394feec0a6","term":"전화번호","zh":"电话号码","audio":"